    "text": "By KIMT Storm Alert Weather 3 ,\n11 hours ago Today's snow has passed and winds have returned to more moderate speeds this evening, however, roads are still in rough shape following the day's events. All winter alerts have been canceled in our immediate area. Temperatures overnight will drop back into the single digits above zero under partly to mostly cloudy skies. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
